      "title": "The work plan's contract",
      "description": "The contract the work plan (beans) keeps as a data store, as operations any Tool must provide: get, list, create, update with ifMatch, note, history, and where a bean is in its processes. Give back a bean exactly as written, keep ids unique and links whole, keep status and type to their closed lists, lose nothing to concurrent writers, and answer a bean's history. A mechanical Actor plays this Role through whichever Tool the deployment names.",
